{"version":1,"content":"<p>講起泰國信武里府（Sing Buri），可能好多人連個名都未聽過，但原來呢個距離曼谷大約兩小時車程嘅地方，竟然係一個盛產南瓜嘅農業省府！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;日前獲泰國政府旅遊局邀請，去咗信武里府參觀當地一年一度嘅盛大活動，除咗煙花、舞台表</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T09:24:19.621215+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:00:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T09:19:39.185849+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T09:19:39.185849+00:00","content_hash":"aa708a45404a6a03af1e5ab03fe8950e224c5fd89871482adb6cf58bd177ad88","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}